# Implementation Plan - Route Duplication Fix

Bhai, aapne ekdum sahi bug pakda hai! Route count isliye badh raha hai kyunki backend code har trip ko ek naya route maan raha hai agar wo thoda sa bhi alag ho. 

## Problem (Kyu badh raha hai count?)
1. **Reverse Routes:** Agar route A -> B hai, aur bus B -> A wapas aati hai, toh system use naya route (duplicate) bana deta hai, jabki rules ke mutabik reverse route alag nahi hona chahiye.
2. **Short Trips (Subsets):** Agar koi route Stop 1 se Stop 10 tak ka hai, aur ek bus Stop 2 se Stop 8 tak chalti hai, toh system usko bhi ek naya "Route Variant" bana raha tha. 
3. Is wajah se har chhoti-badi trip par ek naya route ban raha hai aur 2006 se ginti 6443 tak pahunch gayi!

## Proposed Changes

---

### Backend Logic Update

#### [MODIFY] [routeLearning.ts](file:///c:/Users/Azad%20Singh/Desktop/upbus/apps/backend/src/engine/routeLearning.ts)
- `INSERT INTO routes` wale logic se pehle hum ek **Bidirectional aur Subset Checking Algorithm** lagayenge.
- Ab backend check karega ki:
  - Kya ye trip kisi existing route ka hissa hai? (Forward Check)
  - Kya ye trip kisi existing route ka **ulta (Reverse)** hissa hai? (Reverse Check)
- Agar dono mein se kuch bhi match hua, toh naya route CREATE NAHI hoga. Isse duplicates banne hamesha ke liye band ho jayenge.

